    <item>
      <title>A.J.G.A.R — The Robotic Arm</title>
      <link>https://namikxgithub.github.io/projects/ajgar-robotic-arm/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://namikxgithub.github.io/projects/ajgar-robotic-arm/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Overview
    &lt;div id=&#34;overview&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#overview&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A 6 Degrees-of-Freedom robotic arm built at &lt;a
  href=&#34;https://github.com/atom-robotics-lab/robotic-arm-atom&#34;
    target=&#34;_blank&#34;
  &gt;A.T.O.M Robotics Lab&lt;/a&gt; for autonomous object manipulation and teleoperation. The system integrates computer vision for perception-driven pick-and-place and supports remote operation.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Key Features
    &lt;div id=&#34;key-features&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#key-features&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomous Pick-and-Place&lt;/strong&gt; — Vision-guided object detection and grasping using YOLOv8 and depth sensing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Motion Planning&lt;/strong&gt; — MoveIt-based trajectory planning with collision avoidance in cluttered workspaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teleoperation&lt;/strong&gt; — Remote control interface for manual arm operation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simulation&lt;/strong&gt; — Full Gazebo environment with custom gripper plugins for virtual testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modular Architecture&lt;/strong&gt; — Seven specialized ROS packages covering control, description (URDF), hardware drivers, perception, planning, simulation, and plugins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Tech Stack
    &lt;div id=&#34;tech-stack&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#tech-stack&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;ROS Noetic&lt;/code&gt; · &lt;code&gt;MoveIt&lt;/code&gt; · &lt;code&gt;Gazebo&lt;/code&gt; · &lt;code&gt;OpenCV&lt;/code&gt; · &lt;code&gt;YOLOv8&lt;/code&gt; · &lt;code&gt;Arduino&lt;/code&gt; · &lt;code&gt;Raspberry Pi&lt;/code&gt; · &lt;code&gt;Python&lt;/code&gt; · &lt;code&gt;C++&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
